    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a top-down roguelike deck-building game where you can combine a wide variety of cards to unleash unimaginable attack effects. With a high degree of freedom in deck construction, countless powerful combos await your creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is set in a magical forest ruled by a dark lord. You will take on the role of a brave cat hero summoned from the city, fighting to rescue animal companions under the dark lord's control. Build powerful combos, defeat the dark forces, and save the enchanted forest!</p>",
